WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.292
By the end of this section, you will be able to:

2
00:00:05.292 --> 00:00:08.660
Perform blood culture collection using aseptic technique.

3
00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:11.546
Prevent contamination and maintain specimen quality.

4
00:00:11.546 --> 00:00:13.471
Interpret blood culture results.

5
00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:17.801
And describe the nursing responsibilities in blood culture sampling.

